\newlabel{lst:c32-prufvtx}{{30.2.2}{1776}{CF 2190D framework. Reads the forest, DSU-merges to identify components and sizes, precomputes modpow, and folds a per-vertex count along the component spine. The full combinatorial filter (which labels inside a component root can be P(T)) is a subtree convolution implemented as a small-to-large merge; this listing shows the outer skeleton with the fold as a function stub. ASCII only, identifiers without underscores}{lstlisting.30.2.2}{}}
